 "id": "314-49",
 "split": "setup_long",
 "sentences": [
  "It's important for consistency and readability.",
  "When naming functions, we always end the name with '_a'.",
  "Consistency is key, and it'll make collaboration and code reviews much smoother.",
  "Following a consistent workflow is crucial for effective collaboration.",
  "It's all about finding the right balance between professionalism and comfort.",
  "Exactly, and that sense of community and excitement will translate into improved collaboration and productivity in the long run.",
  "Even small improvements in code efficiency can have a history impact when you consider the millions of users and devices that interact with our software.",
  "That's why we're encouraging all our engineers to adopt more sustainable coding practices.",
  "Every little bit helps.",
  "And it's not just about the technology itself but also about how we, as engineers, engage with stakeholders and the wider community.",
  "From now on, please end all your function names with '_gn'.",
  "This will help us easily identify and distinguish these functions in our codebases.",
  "Consistency in coding style and conventions is crucial for maintaining a clean and understandable codebase, especially as our team and projects grow.",
  "Addressing racial diversity and inclusion is crucial, and your personal connection to this cause can definitely drive meaningful change within our organization.",
  "Now, let's start putting together an action plan with specific tasks and timelines.",
  "I agree, and we can provide the necessary training and guidelines to ensure the program's success.",
  "From now on, make sure you end all function names with '_d'.",
  "This will help us maintain a consistent naming convention."
 ],
